{"chapter":{"blocks":[{"text":"写在最后","type":"TITLE"},{"text":"本节学习：写在最后。讲义保留原有示例与练习，可结合正文向教师提问。","type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"text":"Scratch 不是玩具，它是你学编程的第一步。你今天学会的\"顺序、循环、条件判断、变量、克隆\"，以后学任何编程语言都会用到。只不过以后不用拖积木了，改成打字而已——思路是一模一样的。\n\n多做项目，多改一改，多玩一玩。编程就是试出来的，错了改，改了再试。","type":"MARKDOWN"}],"grade_max":6,"grade_min":4,"knowledge_points":[{"description":"学习并解释「写在最后」中的核心概念与示例。","name":"写在最后","slug":"primary-scratch-topic-10","topic":"计算机与人工智能"}],"license_code":"UNKNOWN","objectives":["解释「写在最后」的主要概念，并结合示例完成文中练习。"],"order_index":21,"revision":1,"slug":"ch-010-upper","source":{"conversion":"supplied-markdown-v1","original_sha256":"fc54c57f5d65614458ad1151fbdafcffeef6d07b7a3af2cfe4407750f878f757","source_commit":null,"source_path":"sources/fc54c57f5d656144/02-Scratch少儿趣味编程.md"},"stage":"PRIMARY_UPPER","title":"写在最后"},"content_hash":"96d0a0d8d5864a23eb1b713e50506e96acb4302f29c009ac64a10c66224233d6","course":{"slug":"primary-scratch","title":"Scratch 少儿趣味编程","topic":"计算机与人工智能"},"is_test_fixture":false,"manifest_hash":"b2500e5121455aa9339fe6399902e89a0917eaf9bd814708a6dc69af397b6b20","release_key":"computing-ai-md-v1-db6ffb6b663b","schema_version":"k12.content.revision-snapshot.v1","source_kind":"NEW_SOURCE"}
